<item><title>Madagascar court allows constitutional referendum before presidential vote</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-allows-constitutional-referendum-before-be9e28/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-allows-constitutional-referendum-before-be9e28/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The High Constitutional Court ruled that a referendum to adopt a new constitution can proceed before the presidential election.</description><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 07:00:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-allows-constitutional-referendum-before-be9e28/share.jpg" length="42707" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-court-allows-constitutional-referendum-before-be9e28/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
